WEBVTT

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:30.980
Saul is like, “I spoke to JR,
he’s down to do a project in prison.”

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:33.691
Scott's like, "That's amazing,
let me call the governor."

00:02:33.691 --> 00:02:35.568
Hung up the phone, called the governor.

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:37.612
Governor was like, "Who's this JR?"

00:02:37.612 --> 00:02:39.030
"He does black and white,

00:02:39.071 --> 00:02:43.159
and, you know, he takes photos of people,
he records their story ..."

00:02:43.201 --> 00:02:44.952
"I'm sorry, I've never heard of it."

00:02:44.994 --> 00:02:46.746
"Yes, there's very large murals."

00:02:46.787 --> 00:02:49.540
And the governor was like,
"Wait, wait, wait.

00:02:49.582 --> 00:02:53.586
Before I was the governor,
I was in a mural.

00:02:53.586 --> 00:02:55.338
There were 1,300 people,

00:02:55.379 --> 00:02:58.257
each one of them recorded
their story, and I was one of them.

00:02:58.257 --> 00:02:59.926
Is that the same artist?"

00:02:59.967 --> 00:03:02.094
The guy said, "Yes,
that's the same artist."